{
 "description": "APD membership vectors (protocol/apd.md). rule_valid: a rule as given (null or missing keys allowed) and the normalised rule every implementation must produce; rule_invalid: refused with the error given. membership_valid / membership_invalid likewise for {apd, number, expires} (missing keys are null). status: the verdict for a rule, a membership and the local date the check is for: missing, not_accepted, expired, valid, in that order of precedence. Written by hand from protocol/apd.md; the server, the Pi controller and the Dart controller and app all run these. Package H (decisions MEM-1 to MEM-6): country_valid / country_invalid: a field's country as given and refused with country_invalid; default_country: the country a field gets from its time zone (null: unset); wording: which words the screens use for a country (apd: Portugal's APD texts; membership: 'association membership', for any other country or none); choices: what a field of a country offers from the given project list and its rule's own entries (the entries of the country, then the own ones; none from the project for a field without a country); status cases do not depend on the country.",
